Gate: Schema

Purpose:
  Defines schema for gate entities.

Required:
  @gate <id>
  condition <condition>
  evidence <evidence>
  threshold <threshold>
  owner <role>
  decision <PASS|FAIL|BLOCKED|SKIPPED|WAIVED>

Optional:
  severity <BLOCKER|CRITICAL|HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|INFO>
  status <PENDING|RUNNING|PASSED|FAILED|BLOCKED|SKIPPED|WAIVED|EXPIRED>
  waiver:
    reason <reason>
    approved <approver>
    expires <date>
  related <task-id>

Example:
  @gate SEC-GATE-001
  condition No critical vulnerability
  evidence SAST report
  threshold Critical=0 High=0
  owner Security
  decision PASSED
  severity BLOCKER
  status PASSED

State: +
  
